      "id": "reading",
      "className": "panel",
      "type": "rich",
      "html": "<span class=\"number\">INPUT · 4 MIN</span><h2>Read, listen to your own voice, and notice</h2><p class=\"instruction\">Read once for meaning. Then read aloud; on the second pass, notice how the speaker uses whole phrases.</p><div class=\"reading\">Here's my update. Yesterday, I finished the login screen. Today, I'm going to connect it to the server. I'm still working on the mobile version, so it isn't ready to test yet. One blocker is the missing API documentation. I need that documentation from the other team. I usually start by checking our task board, and I share any questions with the product manager. The deadline is Friday. After this meeting, I'm going to ask when the documentation will be ready. At the end of the day, I'll send another short update.</div>"
    },
