      "html": "<span class=\"number\">VARIATION · 4 MIN</span><h2>Change it, then make it yours</h2><p class=\"instruction\">Say each answer first, then type a short sentence. Two quick variations per chunk; keep the same pattern.</p><div class=\"variation-item\"><h3>1. Yesterday, I finished…</h3><label class=\"practice-label\" for=\"chunk-v1-var-1-a\">A. Use this idea: update the help page.</label><input class=\"text \" type=\"text\" id=\"chunk-v1-var-1-a\" data-save=\"chunk-v1-var-1-a\"><label class=\"practice-label\" for=\"chunk-v1-var-1-b\">B. Make a different sentence about your own work.</label><input class=\"text \" type=\"text\" id=\"chunk-v1-var-1-b\" data-save=\"chunk-v1-var-1-b\"></div><div class=\"variation-item\"><h3>2. Today, I'm going to…</h3><label class=\"practice-label\" for=\"chunk-v1-var-2-a\">A. Use this idea: review the new design.</label><input class=\"text \" type=\"text\" id=\"chunk-v1-var-2-a\" data-save=\"chunk-v1-var-2-a\"><label class=\"practice-label\" for=\"chunk-v1-var-2-b\">B. Make a different sentence about your own work.</label><input class=\"text \" type=\"text\" id=\"chunk-v1-var-2-b\" data-save=\"chunk-v1-var-2-b\"></div><div class=\"variation-item\"><h3>3. I'm still working on…</h3><label class=\"practice-label\" for=\"chunk-v1-var-3-a\">A. Use this idea: the login screen.</label><input class=\"text \" type=\"text\" id=\"chunk-v1-var-3-a\" data-save=\"chunk-v1-var-3-a\"><label class=\"practice-label\" for=\"chunk-v1-var-3-b\">B. Make a different sentence about your own work.</label><input class=\"text \" type=\"text\" id=\"chunk-v1-var-3-b\" data-save=\"chunk-v1-var-3-b\"></div><div class=\"variation-item\"><h3>4. One blocker is…</h3><label class=\"practice-label\" for=\"chunk-v1-var-4-a\">A. Use this idea: the missing design.</label><input class=\"text \" type=\"text\" id=\"chunk-v1-var-4-a\" data-save=\"chunk-v1-var-4-a\"><label class=\"practice-label\" for=\"chunk-v1-var-4-b\">B. Make a different sentence about your own work.</label><input class=\"text \" type=\"text\" id=\"chunk-v1-var-4-b\" data-save=\"chunk-v1-var-4-b\"></div><div class=\"variation-item\"><h3>5. I need… from…</h3><label class=\"practice-label\" for=\"chunk-v1-var-5-a\">A. Use this idea: feedback / the designer.</label><input class=\"text \" type=\"text\" id=\"chunk-v1-var-5-a\" data-save=\"chunk-v1-var-5-a\"><label class=\"practice-label\" for=\"chunk-v1-var-5-b\">B. Make a different sentence about your own work.</label><input class=\"text \" type=\"text\" id=\"chunk-v1-var-5-b\" data-save=\"chunk-v1-var-5-b\"></div>"
